<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: ultratech arm -->
  <BIE_UltratechBionicArm.label>ウルトラテック上肢</BIE_UltratechBionicArm.label>
  <!-- EN: An ultratech-level arm replacement, built with cutting-edge biocomponents and equipped with self-replicating, multi-purpose mechanites that allow it to outperform most man-made bionics in every way. Its appearance can be adjusted by the user at will, with an option to perfectly mimic a biological arm if they so desire. -->
  <BIE_UltratechBionicArm.description>最先端のバイオ部品と自己複製を行う多目的メカナイトを備えたウルトラテック級の上肢置換。ほとんどの人造義肢を総合的に凌駕し、外観は使用者の意志で自在に変更可能で、生体上肢を完全に模倣する設定もできる。</BIE_UltratechBionicArm.description>

  <!-- EN: ultratech ear -->
  <BIE_UltratechBionicEar.label>ウルトラテック耳</BIE_UltratechBionicEar.label>
  <!-- EN: An ultratech-level ear replacement, built with cutting-edge biocomponents and equipped with self-replicating, multi-purpose mechanites that allow it to outperform most man-made bionics in every way. It features audio filters that enable real-time adjustment of sensitivity to specific sounds and frequencies. -->
  <BIE_UltratechBionicEar.description>ウルトラテック級の耳置換。最先端のバイオ部品と自己複製メカナイトにより、人造義肢の多くを上回る性能を持つ。音声フィルターで特定の音や周波数に対する感度をリアルタイムに調整できる。</BIE_UltratechBionicEar.description>

  <!-- EN: ultratech eye -->
  <BIE_UltratechBionicEye.label>ウルトラテック眼</BIE_UltratechBionicEye.label>
  <!-- EN: An ultratech-level eye replacement, built with cutting-edge biocomponents and equipped with self-replicating, multi-purpose mechanites that allow it to outperform most man-made bionics in every way. Its appearance can be changed by the user at will, with no pattern or color limitations, which has sparked bizarre fashion trends and rendered retina scanners nearly obsolete as a security measure. -->
  <BIE_UltratechBionicEye.description>ウルトラテック級の眼置換。最先端のバイオ部品と自己複製メカナイトにより高性能を実現し、外観は無制限に変更可能で、奇抜なファッションを生み出し網膜スキャナを事実上無効化した。</BIE_UltratechBionicEye.description>

  <!-- EN: ultratech heart -->
  <BIE_UltratechBionicHeart.label>ウルトラテック心臓</BIE_UltratechBionicHeart.label>
  <!-- EN: An ultratech-level heart replacement, built with cutting-edge biocomponents and equipped with self-replicating, multi-purpose mechanites that allow it to outperform most man-made bionics in every way. A regular release of biowelder mechanites and coagulating factors into the bloodstream ensures a quick and safe recovery from injuries. -->
  <BIE_UltratechBionicHeart.description>ウルトラテック級の心臓置換。生体溶接メカナイトと凝固因子を定期的に血流へ放出し、損傷からの迅速かつ安全な回復を促す。ほとんどの人工心臓を凌駕する性能を持つ。</BIE_UltratechBionicHeart.description>

  <!-- EN: ultratech jaw -->
  <BIE_UltratechBionicJaw.label>ウルトラテック顎</BIE_UltratechBionicJaw.label>
  <!-- EN: An ultratech-level jaw replacement, built with cutting-edge biocomponents and equipped with self-replicating, multi-purpose mechanites that allow it to outperform most man-made bionics in every way. It features an advanced voice modulator and an autonomous self-cleaning system, making it especially favored by diplomats and by those with a crippling aversion to dentists. -->
  <BIE_UltratechBionicJaw.description>ウルトラテック級の顎置換。高度な音声変調器と自律型の自浄システムを備え、外交官や歯科恐怖症の者に特に好まれる。多目的メカナイトにより高い性能を発揮する。</BIE_UltratechBionicJaw.description>

  <!-- EN: ultratech kidney -->
  <BIE_UltratechBionicKidney.label>ウルトラテック腎臓</BIE_UltratechBionicKidney.label>
  <!-- EN: An ultratech-level kidney replacement, built with cutting-edge biocomponents and equipped with self-replicating, multi-purpose mechanites that allow it to outperform most man-made bionics in every way. Its advanced microfilters and viruskiller mechanites ensure a high resistance to and quick recovery from diseases and intake of toxic substances. -->
  <BIE_UltratechBionicKidney.description>ウルトラテック級の腎臓置換。高度なマイクロフィルターとウイルスキラー機能を持つメカナイトにより、疾病や有毒物質摂取に対する高い耐性と迅速な回復を実現する。</BIE_UltratechBionicKidney.description>

  <!-- EN: ultratech leg -->
  <BIE_UltratechBionicLeg.label>ウルトラテック下肢</BIE_UltratechBionicLeg.label>
  <!-- EN: An ultratech-level leg replacement, built with cutting-edge biocomponents and equipped with self-replicating, multi-purpose mechanites that allow it to outperform most man-made bionics in every way. Its appearance can be adjusted by the user at will, with an option to perfectly mimic a biological leg if they so desire. -->
  <BIE_UltratechBionicLeg.description>ウルトラテック級の下肢置換。外観は使用者が自在に変更可能で、生体下肢を完全に模倣することもできる。最先端の部品とメカナイトにより高い性能を発揮する。</BIE_UltratechBionicLeg.description>

  <!-- EN: ultratech liver -->
  <BIE_UltratechBionicLiver.label>ウルトラテック肝臓</BIE_UltratechBionicLiver.label>
  <!-- EN: An ultratech-level liver replacement, built with cutting-edge biocomponents and equipped with self-replicating, multi-purpose mechanites that allow it to outperform most man-made bionics in every way. Its advanced microfilters and viruskiller mechanites ensure a high resistance to and quick recovery from diseases and intake of toxic substances. -->
  <BIE_UltratechBionicLiver.description>ウルトラテック級の肝臓置換。高度なマイクロフィルターとウイルスキラー機能を持つメカナイトにより、疾病や有害物質の摂取からの高い耐性と迅速な回復を提供する。</BIE_UltratechBionicLiver.description>

  <!-- EN: ultratech lung -->
  <BIE_UltratechBionicLung.label>ウルトラテック肺</BIE_UltratechBionicLung.label>
  <!-- EN: An ultratech-level lung replacement, built with cutting-edge biocomponents and equipped with self-replicating, multi-purpose mechanites that allow it to outperform most man-made bionics in every way. Its compact oxygen storage system keeps the user safe from being deprived of air for prolonged periods of time. -->
  <BIE_UltratechBionicLung.description>ウルトラテック級の肺置換。コンパクトな酸素貯蔵システムにより、長時間の酸素欠乏から使用者を守る。最先端部品とメカナイトにより高い性能を有する。</BIE_UltratechBionicLung.description>

  <!-- EN: ultratech nose -->
  <BIE_UltratechBionicNose.label>ウルトラテック鼻</BIE_UltratechBionicNose.label>
  <!-- EN: An ultratech-level nose replacement, built with cutting-edge biocomponents and equipped with self-replicating, multi-purpose mechanites that allow it to outperform most man-made bionics in every way. It features olfactory filters that enable real-time adjustment of sensitivity to specific smells. -->
  <BIE_UltratechBionicNose.description>ウルトラテック級の鼻置換。嗅覚フィルターにより特定の匂いに対する感度をリアルタイムで調整できる。高性能なメカナイトと最先端部品を搭載する。</BIE_UltratechBionicNose.description>

  <!-- EN: ultratech skin -->
  <BIE_UltratechBionicSkin.label>ウルトラテック皮膚</BIE_UltratechBionicSkin.label>
  <!-- EN: A small mechanite-infused patch of artificial skin that quickly spreads to cover the user's body upon installation. It's more durable and pleasant to look at than natural skin. The ability to change its color, texture or even smell at will has made it very popular amongst glitterworld models. -->
  <BIE_UltratechBionicSkin.description>メカナイトを含浸させた小さな人工皮膚のパッチ。装着すると素早く体表を覆い、自然皮膚より耐久性と外観の良さを備える。色や質感、匂いまでも自在に変えられるため、グリッターワールドのモデルに人気である。</BIE_UltratechBionicSkin.description>

  <!-- EN: ultratech spine -->
  <BIE_UltratechBionicSpine.label>ウルトラテック脊椎</BIE_UltratechBionicSpine.label>
  <!-- EN: An ultratech-level spine replacement, built with cutting-edge biocomponents and equipped with self-replicating, multi-purpose mechanites that allow it to outperform most man-made bionics in every way. Its incredible durability and flexibility greatly increases the user's strength and mobility. -->
  <BIE_UltratechBionicSpine.description>ウルトラテック級の脊椎置換。驚異的な耐久性と柔軟性により、使用者の筋力と機動性を大幅に高める。</BIE_UltratechBionicSpine.description>

  <!-- EN: ultratech stomach -->
  <BIE_UltratechStomach.label>ウルトラテック胃</BIE_UltratechStomach.label>
  <!-- EN: An ultratech-level stomach replacement, built with cutting-edge biocomponents and equipped with self-replicating, multi-purpose mechanites that allow it to outperform most man-made bionics in every way. It allows for extraction of nutrients from substances normally not digestible by humans. -->
  <BIE_UltratechStomach.description>ウルトラテック級の胃置換。通常の人間では消化できない物質からも栄養を抽出できる最先端の消化機構を備える。</BIE_UltratechStomach.description>

</LanguageData>
